<title>USA: Crowley, Milner &amp; Co Q4 Feb 1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Crowley, Milner &amp; Co Q4 Feb 1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fiscal Year Ended		 Feb 1		 Feb 3</p>
<p>					     1997		  1996</p>
<p>    Net Sales		  $153,003,296*     $105,862,503</p>
<p>    Net Income (Loss)	 $1,812,081**     $(2,344,487)</p>
<p>    Net Income (Loss) Per Share  $1.46**	    $(2.38)</p>
<p>    Common Equivalent shares   1,241,206	    985,808</p>
<p>Fourth Quarter Ended</p>
<p>    Net Sales		   $66,980,999*	$35,942,159</p>
<p>    Net Income		   $4,003,221**	$1,391,410</p>
<p>    Net Income Per Share	    $2.55**	     $1.43</p>
<p>    Common Equivalent shares    1,570,331	   1,227,140</p>
<p>* Comparable store sales for 1996 fiscal year and Q4 were $106,709,622 and $35,600,255, respectively; includes Steinbach Stores reported sales of $46,293,674 from September through year-end; excludes Steinbach Stores sales of $41,139,399, which were recorded during the interim operating agreement (from February 1 through August 31)</p>
<p>** Income from operations from Steinbach Stores for the five months since the acquisition by Crowley's and for the fourth quarter of $1,241,954 and $1,341,745 are included on a consolidated basis.</p>
</text>
